    <bpmn:process id="W_W5457" name="W5457. Job Settlement, Container Demurrage &amp; Scrap/Rebate Recovery Billing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Job completion + customer sign-off (W5455); monthly billing cycle
Frequency: Per job settlement; monthly batch
Volume: ~thousands of settlements/yr
Owner: Services Finance Analyst
Participants: Finance (VS-15/VS-17), Site Cleanup Coordinator, Hauler/Disposer (W5447), Revenue Assurance (VS-118)
Source: workflow W5457 — Job Settlement, Container Demurrage &amp; Scrap/Rebate Recovery Billing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5457_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5457_Lane1" name="Services Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5457_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5457_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5457_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5457_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5457_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5457_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5457_Lane3" name="AP">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5457_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5457_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5457_Start5" name="Job completion + customer sign-off (W5455); monthly billing cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5457_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5457_Task6" name="Reconcile the actual job: volume/weight hauled (W5451), streams routed (W5453)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Reconcile the actual job: volume/weight hauled (W5451), streams routed (W5453), crew-hours, container dwell, and any change orders (W5454) vs the booked estimate (W5448).
Responsible (R): Services Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5457_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5457_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5457_Task7" name="Compute the final price (base service + per-cu.m/per-tonne hauling + container…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Compute the final price (base service + per-cu.m/per-tonne hauling + container demurrage if over-dwell − scrap/rebate recovery credits).
Responsible (R): Services Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5457_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5457_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5457_Task8" name="Recognize revenue per PFRS 15 at completion (VS-157/W5448); book recovery/scrap…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Recognize revenue per PFRS 15 at completion (VS-157/W5448); book recovery/scrap credits against cost of service.
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: per job</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5457_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5457_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5457_Task9" name="Settle vendor invoices (hauler/disposer) with 3-way match against…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Settle vendor invoices (hauler/disposer) with 3-way match against manifests/weight tickets (VS-15 W7); capture demurrage/rebates accurately.
Responsible (R): AP
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: per invoice</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5457_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5457_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5457_Task10" name="Resolve exceptions (overruns, disputed weights, vendor overcharge) and feed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Resolve exceptions (overruns, disputed weights, vendor overcharge) and feed into revenue assurance (VS-118) and pricing health (W5464).
Responsible (R): Services Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: per exception</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5457_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5457_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5457_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5457_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5457_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-805 (ensure controlled execution — Diversion, Disposal, Settlement &amp; Site Cleanup Analytics (PA-191.3).); CTL-114 (ensure PFRS 15 recognition &amp; cut-off control); CTL-14 (ensure AP invoices match PO and GR); operational: scrap/rebate credits captured against cost of service.
Owner: Services Finance Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5457_Assoc13" sourceRef="W5457_Annotation12" targetRef="W5457_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
