      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5458_Start4" name="Settlement (W5457); billing cycle; customer dispute; aging">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5458_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5458_Task5" name="Generate and deliver the customer invoice with the manifest/weight evidence and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Generate and deliver the customer invoice with the manifest/weight evidence and before/after photos attached for transparency.
Responsible (R): AR Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: per invoice</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5458_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5458_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5458_Task6" name="For B2B projects, integrate with progress billing (VS-11 W165/W1288) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: For B2B projects, integrate with progress billing (VS-11 W165/W1288) and project terms (W5446).
Responsible (R): AR Analyst / Project Mgr
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: per project</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5458_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5458_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5458_Task7" name="Resolve disputes using the captured evidence (weight tickets, sign-off W5455…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Resolve disputes using the captured evidence (weight tickets, sign-off W5455, photos); issue credit notes per policy (VS-16 W287).
Responsible (R): AR Analyst / Customer Service
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: per dispute</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5458_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5458_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5458_Task8" name="Monitor AR aging; pursue collections per the standard VS-16 process; coordinate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Monitor AR aging; pursue collections per the standard VS-16 process; coordinate credit risk (VS-68) for B2B.
Responsible (R): AR Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5458_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5458_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5458_Task9" name="Feed dispute root-causes into pricing/service improvement (W5464) and revenue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Feed dispute root-causes into pricing/service improvement (W5464) and revenue assurance (VS-118).
Responsible (R): Services Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5458_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5458_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5458_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5458_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
