        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-21: invoicing accuracy/evidence; CTL-31 (credit-note control); CTL-23 (dispute/fraud guard); operational: every cleanup invoice carries manifest + sign-off evidence.
Owner: AR Analyst (VS-16)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
