    <bpmn:process id="W_W5459" name="W5459. Diversion Rate, Stream Composition &amp; Circular-Economy Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; ESG reporting (VS-25); B2B customer KPI (W5446)
Frequency: Monthly diversion analytics; quarterly review
Volume: 1 diversion/composition analytics view across the program
Owner: Services Analytics Lead
Participants: ESG (VS-25), Sustainability (VS-78/VS-179), Compliance (VS-22), Services Manager
Source: workflow W5459 — Diversion Rate, Stream Composition &amp; Circular-Economy Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5459_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5459_Lane1" name="Services Analytics Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5459_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5459_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5459_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5459_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5459_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5459_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5459_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5459_Start3" name="Monthly/quarterly analytics cycle; ESG reporting (VS-25); B2B customer KPI (W5446)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5459_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5459_Task4" name="Compute diversion rate (diverted-to-recovery ÷ total C&amp;D generated) by job…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compute diversion rate (diverted-to-recovery ÷ total C&amp;D generated) by job, region, channel, and customer; track against target.
Responsible (R): Services Analytics Lead
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5459_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5459_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5459_Task5" name="Analyze stream composition (wood/drywall/masonry/metals/packaging/residuals) to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Analyze stream composition (wood/drywall/masonry/metals/packaging/residuals) to identify high-volume streams for new diversion partnerships.
Responsible (R): Services Analytics Lead
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5459_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5459_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5459_Task6" name="Quantify circular-economy value: scrap-metal recovery, reprocessor credits…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Quantify circular-economy value: scrap-metal recovery, reprocessor credits, biomass/aggregate reuse — vs landfill tip-fee avoided.
Responsible (R): Services Analytics Lead
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5459_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5459_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5459_Task7" name="Benchmark diversion rate vs. industry/ESG expectations and B2B customer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Benchmark diversion rate vs. industry/ESG expectations and B2B customer commitments (W5446).
Responsible (R): Services Analytics Lead
Accountable (A): Sustainability/ESG Manager
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5459_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5459_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5459_Task8" name="Recommend improvements (new recycler partnership, on-site crushing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Recommend improvements (new recycler partnership, on-site crushing, source-reduction) feeding W5453 routing and W5464 strategy.
Responsible (R): Services Analytics Lead
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5459_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5459_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5459_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5459_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5459_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-805 (ensure controlled execution — Diversion, Disposal, Settlement &amp; Site Cleanup Analytics (PA-191.3).) | - operational: diversion rate reported monthly with manifest-backed evidence.
